"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m005-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m005-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"朱亥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004420","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m005-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong","book_id":"b-shiji-077","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-077-weigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p008","text":"公子行，侯生曰：「將在外，主令有所不受，以便國家。公子即合符，而晉鄙不授公子兵而復請之，事必危矣。臣客屠者朱亥可與俱，此人力士。晉鄙聽，大善；不聽，可使擊之。」於是公子泣。侯生曰：「公子畏死邪？何泣也？」公子曰：「晉鄙嚄唶宿將，往恐不聽，必當殺之，是以泣耳，豈畏死哉？」於是公子請朱亥。朱亥笑曰：「臣乃市井鼓刀屠者，而公子親數存之，所以不報謝者，以為小禮無所用。今公子有急，此乃臣效命之秋也。」遂與公子俱。公子過謝侯生。侯生曰：「臣宜從，老不能。請數公子行日，以至晉鄙軍之日，北鄉自剄，以送公子。」公子遂行。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"侯生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"將在外","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"主令","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"公子","kind":"pe