:"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0189","start":189,"end":190,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004420","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"侯生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"侯生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0225","start":225,"end":227,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m008-0249","start":249,"end":251,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-077-weigong","book_id":"b-shiji-077","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-077-weigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:p009","text":"至鄴，矯魏王令代晉鄙。晉鄙合符，疑之，舉手視公子曰：「今吾擁十萬之眾，屯於境上，國之重任，今單車來代之，何如哉？」欲無聽。朱亥袖四十斤鐵椎，椎殺晉鄙，公子遂將晉鄙軍。勒兵下令軍中曰：「父子俱在軍中，父歸；兄弟俱在軍中，兄歸；獨子無兄弟，歸養。」得選兵八萬人，進兵擊秦軍。秦軍解去，遂救邯鄲，存趙。趙王及平原君自迎公子於界，平原君負籣矢為公子先引。趙王再拜曰：「自古賢人未有及公子者也。」當此之時，平原君不敢自比於人。公子與侯生決，至軍，侯生果北鄉自剄。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004413","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"朱亥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004420","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"晉鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004425","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"父子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"父歸","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、未定角色或泛稱保存，不補成員、姓名與親屬；擬立王及書名不當實際爵位授予。"},{"id":"c-shiji-077-weigong:m009-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"兄弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":nu